# ios-webapp-push needs no secret of its own: the VAPID key pair and the tick secret are made inside D1 on first use.
# What it reads at run time comes from the other skills; for a local `npx wrangler pages dev dist --d1 DB=<name>`
# copy the lines you use into .dev.vars (never commit it). On Cloudflare they live in Pages → Settings →
# Variables and Secrets (references/setup.md).
# shared-google-calendar: the calendar the tick reads
GOOGLE_SA_JSON=
GOOGLE_CALENDAR_ID=
# google-signin-team-gate: devices belong to members on this list (Secret)
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
ALLOWED_EMAILS=
